extends ../baseEmail

block content
  p Hi there!
  p We're sorry to see you go! Your subscription will be canceled at the end of your current billing period on: #{payload.user.subscriptionEndDate}
  p We would love to hear your feedback. Please let us know why you are canceling your subscription by filling out this
    a(href=payload.formLink) form.


  p If you change your mind, which we hope you do soon, you can always resubscribe through your dashboard.
  p
    a(href=payload.dashboardLink, class='btn btn-primary') Go to Your Dashboard

  p
    small Thank you for being a part of #{payload.companyName},
    br
    small The #{payload.companyName} Team